  "description": "AWS Redshift IDataSource companion for ToolUp.Platform, over the Redshift Data API (no VPC route or database password needed). Provisioned clusters and Serverless workgroups; submit/poll/page async statement execution with a connector-enforced timeout; catalogue introspection via ListTables/DescribeTable; RFC 4180 CSV output. AWS credentials resolved per call through ISecretStore, or the AWS default credential chain.",
